The matrix is
\[ \begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}. \]
The matrix corresponding to projection onto the $y$-axis is
\[ \begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}. \]
